</center><H1 ALIGN=CENTER> Ranger Guild Info</H1>

<BLOCKQUOTE>
<br><hr><br>
<pre>

File updated March 2006.


From south crossing:

Short route (water): w, 35 s, enter
Long route (no water): 4 s, 7 se, 2 s, 3 e, s, 3 sw, 13 s, 5 sw, 3 w, enter


Sables gives you the information you ask:
Usage: info <lev>  if you specify <lev> it gives info
starting at that level.
Name: Rangers
Command: ranger
Creator: Duke
Maximum level: 35


Description:
The ranger is a hunter and a woodsman who lives not by only his sword
but also his wits.  Robin Hood, Orion, Jack the giant killer, and the
huntress of Dianna are examples of rangers from history and legend.
The abilities of the ranger make him particulary good at tracking,
woodcraft, and spying.


Joining requirements:
 Background must be nomad (wrong or incomplete)


Abilities gained when joining:
 Receive the beloved gift of the Rangers.
 May train skill Attack to 24%
 May train skill Push to 28%
 May train skill Axes to 19%
 May train skill Consider to 38%
 May train skill Tinning to 38%
 May train skill Torch creation to 14%
 May train skill Hiking to 19%
 May train skill Fire building to 19%


